{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LightSup!</strong> is a local co-op beat 'em up game for 1-4 players. Take on a quest to help people by fighting monsters and re-igniting &quot;<strong>The Altar of Light</strong>,&quot; a safeguard artifact that protects the land. As you play, you can improve your adventurer with magical upgrades and equip better weapons to unveil the cause of the Eclipse and save the kingdom from disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/eb957b534e6614d59149a3546fd04245.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/eb957b534e6614d59149a3546fd04245.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/eb957b534e6614d59149a3546fd04245.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/423bec35556fa03ed60fd5ff7e0dd590.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=100 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every quest is an adventure filled with ever-changing challenges, where you will encounter randomly generated battles, events, weapons, Blessings, and Curses\u2014team up with friends to become stronger and face the threats that keep emerging from the darkness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/2fa19a5189c452b5c43b67bb94c6da84.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/2fa19a5189c452b5c43b67bb94c6da84.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/2fa19a5189c452b5c43b67bb94c6da84.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/98ec33cdeefe1c08c924c894ddb363cc.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray to the sacred artifact, the kingdom's symbol of protection, the Altar of Light. Let it illuminate your path, bestow strength upon you and your companion, and empower you to confront the enemies of Lumineia bravely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/5972c63fd4f458a98c664e480d322469.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/5972c63fd4f458a98c664e480d322469.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/5972c63fd4f458a98c664e480d322469.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/7a90e075974b564242d59015df855214.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/7a90e075974b564242d59015df855214.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/7a90e075974b564242d59015df855214.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/ca76af2925fcd6c81896a3543fb06f86.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be cautious when facing overwhelming hordes of monsters, discovering mysterious, unpredictable Blessings and Curses that alter your adventure, and battling powerful bosses and mini-bosses to restore the once-peaceful kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/e6526bcda86e7cf0f3069d44c0d3a1c3.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight a Chaotic Battle:</strong> Save the kingdom from endless hordes of enemies as a novice adventurer party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain Sanity:</strong> Use the Altar of Light to bring illumination to the eternal night, boosting your combat power and helping you overcome challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blessings &amp; Curses:</strong> Collect positive or negative perks that will make each adventure a unique journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite Progression:</strong> Adapt your playstyle with randomized paths that lead to unexpected encounters and help you find new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Unlock Unique Traits:</strong> Discover different play styles through characters with special traits and abilities. Try various ways to upgrade your playable characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enjoy local multiplayer, you'll need at least 1 keyboard and mouse, and up to 3 game controllers. Alternatively, you can also play with 4 game controllers. You can use Steam Remote Play to enjoy gaming sessions with your friends on Steam.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2266750?t=1760624815","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760624815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/7602da810acb68c7031e35c3ee78ee2e09f1b26d/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760624815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/7602da810acb68c7031e35c3ee78ee2e09f1b26d/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760624815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2761140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/84933b404d7f3bdbca7043cda849aedd.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LightSup!</strong> is a local co-op beat 'em up game for 1-4 players. Take on a quest to help people by fighting monsters and re-igniting &quot;<strong>The Altar of Light</strong>,&quot; a safeguard artifact that protects the land. As you play, you can improve your adventurer with magical upgrades and equip better weapons to unveil the cause of the Eclipse and save the kingdom from disaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/eb957b534e6614d59149a3546fd04245.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/eb957b534e6614d59149a3546fd04245.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/eb957b534e6614d59149a3546fd04245.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/423bec35556fa03ed60fd5ff7e0dd590.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=100 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every quest is an adventure filled with ever-changing challenges, where you will encounter randomly generated battles, events, weapons, Blessings, and Curses\u2014team up with friends to become stronger and face the threats that keep emerging from the darkness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/2fa19a5189c452b5c43b67bb94c6da84.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/2fa19a5189c452b5c43b67bb94c6da84.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/2fa19a5189c452b5c43b67bb94c6da84.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/98ec33cdeefe1c08c924c894ddb363cc.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray to the sacred artifact, the kingdom's symbol of protection, the Altar of Light. Let it illuminate your path, bestow strength upon you and your companion, and empower you to confront the enemies of Lumineia bravely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/5972c63fd4f458a98c664e480d322469.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/5972c63fd4f458a98c664e480d322469.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/5972c63fd4f458a98c664e480d322469.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/7a90e075974b564242d59015df855214.poster.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/7a90e075974b564242d59015df855214.webm?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/7a90e075974b564242d59015df855214.mp4?t=1760624815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/ca76af2925fcd6c81896a3543fb06f86.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be cautious when facing overwhelming hordes of monsters, discovering mysterious, unpredictable Blessings and Curses that alter your adventure, and battling powerful bosses and mini-bosses to restore the once-peaceful kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/e6526bcda86e7cf0f3069d44c0d3a1c3.avif?t=1760624815\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight a Chaotic Battle:</strong> Save the kingdom from endless hordes of enemies as a novice adventurer party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain Sanity:</strong> Use the Altar of Light to bring illumination to the eternal night, boosting your combat power and helping you overcome challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blessings &amp; Curses:</strong> Collect positive or negative perks that will make each adventure a unique journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite Progression:</strong> Adapt your playstyle with randomized paths that lead to unexpected encounters and help you find new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Unlock Unique Traits:</strong> Discover different play styles through characters with special traits and abilities. Try various ways to upgrade your playable characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enjoy local multiplayer, you'll need at least 1 keyboard and mouse, and up to 3 game controllers. Alternatively, you can also play with 4 game controllers. You can use Steam Remote Play to enjoy gaming sessions with your friends on Steam.</p>","developers":["BugBlio Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/289302327056092f0a82761195762bb5cd7ce537/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760624815","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2266750/1234244897/2f9a30fd0a8b89bb3c8edc804428124a1687c2c4/1760491915/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760493383","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2266750/1234244897/2f9a30fd0a8b89bb3c8edc804428124a1687c2c4/1760491915/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760493383","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2266750/1234244897/2f9a30fd0a8b89bb3c8edc804428124a1687c2c4/1760491915/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760493383","id":257218012,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218012/movie480.mp4?t=1760493383","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218012/movie_max.mp4?t=1760493383"},"name":"LightSup! Gamescom Asia x Thailand Game Show 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218012/b636c9167c8c2096b6943fe20749d4033df03e0c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760493383","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218012/movie480.webm?t=1760493383","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218012/movie_max.webm?t=1760493383"}}],"name":"LightSup!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 // AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versi