t=1760624815","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/3fa468c845e41c4ff6cbd276ea5fbafcf056689f/ss_3fa468c845e41c4ff6cbd276ea5fbafcf056689f.600x338.jpg?t=1760624815"}],"short_description":"Join the adventure in a couch co-op beat 'em up game for 1-4 players with rogue-lite elements! Battle fierce monsters crawling from dungeons and forests. Equip your weapons, worship the Altar of Lights to light your path, and free the Lumineia Kingdom from the Eclipse and its everlasting darkness!","steam_appid":2266750,"support_info":{"email":"contact@bugbliostudio.com","url":"https://www.bugbliostudio.com/LightSup"},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://www.bugbliostudio.com/LightSup"}